WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.485
- I have a headache and
Google says it's brain cancer.

00:00:04.485 --> 00:00:06.118
Do I have brain cancer?

00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:08.618
(jazzy music)

00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:11.809
- Hey mom, so I'm having
people over for the first time

00:00:11.809 --> 00:00:14.433
this weekend, and I really need
your mac and cheese recipe.

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:17.010
- So what exactly are
stocks, how do I get them?

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.042
Do I need them?

00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:19.567
- What should I make for the main dish?

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.660
- Who sings that Motown
song with the lyrics.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.900
I don't know something
about heaven, charm.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.838
There's an arm in there.

00:00:26.838 --> 00:00:29.059
- Can I just get all your recipes?

00:00:29.059 --> 00:00:31.051
Just, yeah, just send 'em all to me.

00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:34.492
No, mom, not by mail,
just email them to me.

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:35.710
- Can I get your Netflix password?

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.286
- So how much is too
much to pay for braids?

00:00:38.286 --> 00:00:39.119
- Hulu?

00:00:39.119 --> 00:00:41.294
- So how exactly do you
fold a fitted sheet?

00:00:41.294 --> 00:00:42.776
'Cause it's not looking quite right.

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:43.609
- HBO?

00:00:44.552 --> 00:00:45.673
It won't cost you anything.

00:00:45.673 --> 00:00:47.927
- How many times can
you wash a zip lock bag?

00:00:47.927 --> 00:00:50.152
- Mommy, you need to talk to Sepha.

00:00:50.152 --> 00:00:51.990
I know she's my sister, I love her,

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.997
but she is acting crazy.

00:00:53.997 --> 00:00:56.546
- How often am I supposed to oil my scalp?

00:00:56.546 --> 00:00:58.364
- When is cousin Shawn's birthday?

00:00:58.364 --> 00:00:59.561
- Can you do my taxes for me?

00:00:59.561 --> 00:01:00.830
- And what about Uncle Antonio?

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.678
Oh (beep), could you
apologize to him for me?

00:01:04.678 --> 00:01:08.985
Yes, thank you and I
promise I will stop cussing.

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:10.799
- Do we have Native
American in our family?

00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:11.632
Really?

00:01:12.777 --> 00:01:13.812
What tribe?

00:01:13.812 --> 00:01:15.928
- Hey, I just wanted to
tell you that I love you

00:01:15.928 --> 00:01:16.891
and I miss you.

00:01:16.891 --> 00:01:20.247
- And, I'm glad that I can
come to you for advice.

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:22.939
Yeah, I'm making sure I get my vitamins.

00:01:22.939 --> 00:01:27.001
Yeah, uh, huh, I'm getting enough sleep.

00:01:27.001 --> 00:01:28.669
Mom, I'm an adult.

00:01:28.669 --> 00:01:31.169
(jazzy music)

